# Cache policy for the Desk's static assets (Workers Static Assets).
# Hashed files under /assets/ never change once built, so they are immutable and cached for a year.
# The HTML shell and SPA routes must revalidate so a new deploy is picked up at once.
# /api/* never reaches assets: the Worker answers it, and it sends no-store itself.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
